    steps: ["Set up four stations: corner battle, net-front battle, 1-on-1 angling, and full-ice sprint.","Players spend ninety seconds at each station at full compete level.","Rotate on the whistle with no rest between stations.","Complete the circuit twice; the second round separates the conditioned from the tired."],
    coachingPoints: ["Compete on every battle \u2014 the circuit only works at game intensity.","Move quickly between stations; standing around kills the conditioning effect.","Finish every station; cutting a station short cheats the whole group."],
