    setup: "Cones on the far faceoff dots as turn markers. Two teams at the goal line.",
    steps: ["Two teams line up at the goal line; first skater sprints around the far faceoff dot and back.","The skater tags the next teammate, who sprints the same route.","Continue until every skater has gone; the first team done wins.","Run it again with players carrying pucks for a harder second round."],
    coachingPoints: ["Run the relay at full speed \u2014 it is supposed to be tiring and fun.","Tag the next skater cleanly; fumbled tags lose the race.","Encourage every team; the loudest bench usually wins the relay."],
