    steps: ["Two lines face each other across the ice, each player paired with someone opposite.","Players skate toward each other exchanging passes, then join the back of the far line.","After four minutes, switch to backward skating for the pass exchange.","Finish with one-touch passes to sharpen the hands before the main drills."],
    coachingPoints: ["Passes should be firm enough to reach but soft enough to receive cleanly.","Skate through the reception \u2014 the warmup sets the tempo for practice.","Keep the lines moving; standing in line cools the legs down."],
