    steps: ["Players line up at center ice on both sides of the red line, pucks with the second player in line.","First player skates backward, receives a pass from the second player, and opens up forward.","Player skates around the far cone, drives wide, and shoots on the net.","Shooter joins the back of the opposite line; run from both sides."],
